  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Mer&ugrave; Gioielli, a renowned fine jewellery brand from Milan, has captivated the hearts of jewellery connoisseurs since its establishment in 1959. Our exceptional craftsmanship and unique designs have gained us recognition both locally and internationally.</p>\r\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">&bull; Product description:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Mer&ugrave; Gioielli combines the finest materials to create their jewellery collection. Diamonds, rubies, sapphires, and emeralds are harmonised with hand-painted enamel portraits or gemstones, resulting in enchanting jewellery pieces.</p>\r\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Each piece is hand-crafted with the highest quality materials in 18K gold. There is an artisanal component to your jewelry. Each piece is unique.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">&nbsp;</p>",
